  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cook the pasta according to the packet instructions. Reserve some of the cooking water."
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine all the mushrooms in a bowl (roughly chop the portobellos, separate the shimeji from their base, halve the king oysters and tear the oyster mushrooms). Heat a pan over high heat and sear the mushrooms with no oil until they brown. Add the olive oil, salt and pepper and stir. Add half the wine, 1 tbsp butter and the sage and cook until the liquid reduces, then add 1-2 ladles of pasta cooking water."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the oregano and the remaining wine, stir, then add the pasta and remaining butter and toss. Grate over some Parmesan, turn off the heat and mix."
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve scattered with basil and a few shavings of Parmesan cut with a peeler."
    }
  ]
